<header><div class="wrap nav"><a class="brand" href="/" aria-label="DATLUME" style="display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;text-decoration:none;color:#fff"><img src="/favicon.svg" alt="" width="24" height="24" style="display:block;width:24px;height:24px;filter:brightness(0) invert(1)"><span style="font-family:'Segoe UI Variable','Avenir Next','Helvetica Neue',system-ui,sans-serif;font-size:19px;font-weight:750;letter-spacing:.16em;line-height:1">DATLUME</span></a><div class="navlinks"><a href="/procurement/">国・自治体の案件</a><a href="/realestate/">不動産・暮らし</a><a href="/regional/">都道府県別推移</a><a href="/employment-economy/">雇用・賃金</a><a href="/business-industry/">企業・産業</a><a href="/economy-prices/">経済・物価</a><a href="/energy/">エネルギー</a><a href="/about-data/">データについて</a></div></div></header>
<main class="wrap">
  <section class="intro"><h1>街を、価格だけで選ばない。</h1><p>地価・防災に、人口、高齢化率、治安、交通事故、病院、学校、駅、飲食店を重ねて、街をいろいろな角度から見られます。</p></section>
  <section class="dashboard">
    <aside id="filters-panel" class="panel">
      <div class="panel-head"><h2>表示条件</h2><button id="filters-toggle" class="panel-toggle" type="button" aria-expanded="true">条件を閉じる</button></div>
      <div class="group"><label class="label" for="prefecture">都道府県</label><select id="prefecture"><option value="">全国</option></select></div>
      <div class="group"><label class="label" for="price-dataset">地価データ</label><select id="price-dataset"><option value="landPrice">地価公示（2026）</option><option value="landSurvey">都道府県地価調査（2026）</option></select><label class="layer"><span><i class="keydot" style="background:#1769e0"></i>地価地点</span><input id="layer-price" class="toggle" type="checkbox" checked /></label></div>
      <div class="group"><span class="label">不動産・防災</span>
        <label class="layer"><span><i class="keygrad" style="background:linear-gradient(90deg,#fff7bc,#fed98e,#fc9272,#e34a9a,#c06bd8)"></i>洪水浸水想定</span><input id="layer-flood" class="toggle" type="checkbox" checked /></label>
        <label class="layer"><span><i class="keygrad" style="background:linear-gradient(90deg,#fff7bc,#fed98e,#fc9272,#e34a9a,#c06bd8)"></i>津波浸水想定</span><input id="layer-tsunami" class="toggle" type="checkbox" /></label>
        <label class="layer"><span><i class="keygrad" style="background:linear-gradient(90deg,#f1d42b 0 50%,#bd0026 50% 100%)"></i>土砂災害（土石流）</span><input id="layer-sediment" class="toggle" type="checkbox" /></label>
      </div>
      <div class="group"><label class="label" for="stat-layer">地域統計</label><select id="stat-layer">
        <option value="">表示しない</option><option value="population">人口</option><option value="elderly">高齢化率</option><option value="crime">犯罪率</option><option value="accident">交通事故</option>
      </select></div>
      <div class="group"><span class="label">施設・生活</span>
        <label class="layer"><span><i class="keydot" style="background:#0ea5e9"></i>病院（2020）</span><input id="layer-hospital" class="toggle" type="checkbox" /></label>
        <label class="layer"><span><i class="keydot" style="background:#8b5cf6"></i>学校（2023）</span><input id="layer-school" class="toggle" type="checkbox" /></label>
        <label class="layer"><span><i class="keydot" style="background:#059669"></i>駅（2025）</span><input id="layer-station" class="toggle" type="checkbox" /></label>
        <label class="layer"><span><i class="keydot" style="background:#f59e0b"></i>飲食店（OSM・拡大時）</span><input id="layer-restaurant" class="toggle" type="checkbox" /></label>
      </div>
      <div class="group"><span class="label">色の見方</span><div class="color-key">
        <div class="row"><i class="swatch" style="background:#1769e0"></i><span>青：地価地点のまとまり</span></div>
        <div class="row"><i class="grad" style="background:linear-gradient(90deg,#fff7bc,#fed98e,#fc9272,#e34a9a,#c06bd8)"></i><span>洪水：浸水浅 ↗ 深</span></div>
        <div class="row"><i class="grad" style="background:linear-gradient(90deg,#fff7bc,#fed98e,#fc9272,#e34a9a,#c06bd8)"></i><span>津波：浸水浅 ↗ 深</span></div>
        <div class="row"><i class="grad" style="background:linear-gradient(90deg,#f1d42b 0 50%,#bd0026 50% 100%)"></i><span>土砂災害：警戒区域 ↗ 特別警戒区域</span></div>
        <div class="row"><i class="swatch" style="background:#ef4444"></i><span>赤：交通事故</span></div>
        <div class="row"><i class="swatch" style="background:#0ea5e9"></i><span>水色：病院</span></div>
        <div class="row"><i class="swatch" style="background:#8b5cf6"></i><span>紫：学校</span></div>
        <div class="row"><i class="swatch" style="background:#059669"></i><span>緑：駅</span></div>
        <div class="row"><i class="swatch" style="background:#f59e0b"></i><span>橙：飲食店</span></div>
        <div class="row"><i class="grad" style="background:linear-gradient(90deg,#bfdbfe,#1e3a8a)"></i><span>人口：薄青 ↗ 濃青</span></div>
        <div class="row"><i class="grad" style="background:linear-gradient(90deg,#86efac,#fde047,#fb923c,#dc2626)"></i><span>高齢化率：緑 ↗ 赤</span></div>
        <div class="row"><i class="grad" style="background:linear-gradient(90deg,#fde68a,#f97316,#dc2626)"></i><span>犯罪率：黄 ↗ 赤</span></div>
      </div></div>
      <div class="group"><span id="current-price-label" class="label">表示中の地価公示</span><div class="kpis"><div class="kpi"><small>地点数</small><b id="kpi-count">—</b></div><div class="kpi"><small>中央値</small><b id="kpi-median">—</b></div></div></div>
      <div class="group"><span class="label">地価の推移</span><button id="price-history-load" class="history-btn" type="button">2020〜2026を見る</button><div id="price-history-mini" class="history-mini" hidden><svg id="price-history-svg" viewBox="0 0 280 110" preserveAspectRatio="none" aria-label="地価推移"></svg><div id="price-history-caption" class="history-caption"></div></div></div>
      <p class="note">各レイヤーは出典年度が異なります。犯罪率は2025年の刑法犯認知件数を2024年人口で割った都道府県単位の参考値。交通事故は2024年の警察庁事故データを約1kmグリッドに集約しています。</p>
    </aside>
    <div class="map-card">
      <div class="map-toolbar"><strong>全国 不動産・防災・暮らしデータマップ</strong><span id="map-status">データを読み込み中</span></div>
      <div id="map"></div><div id="loading" class="loading">全国25,000地点の地価データを読み込み中…</div>
      <div id="legend" class="legend"><strong>地価（円/㎡）</strong><div><i class="dot" style="background:#22c55e"></i>10万円未満</div><div><i class="dot" style="background:#eab308"></i>10〜30万円</div><div><i class="dot" style="background:#f97316"></i>30〜100万円</div><div><i class="dot" style="background:#dc2626"></i>100万円以上</div></div>
    </div>
  </section>
</main>
<script is:inline type="module">
import * as maplibregl from '/vendor/maplibre-6.11.1/maplibre-gl.mjs';
maplibregl.setWorkerUrl('/vendor/maplibre-6.11.1/maplibre-gl-worker.mjs');
const fmt=(v)=>new Intl.NumberFormat('ja-JP').format(Math.round(v||0));
const $=(id)=>document.getElementById(id);
const filtersPanel=$('filters-panel'),filtersToggle=$('filters-toggle');
function setFiltersOpen(open){filtersPanel.classList.toggle('mobile-collapsed',!open);filtersToggle.setAttribute('aria-expanded',String(open));filtersToggle.textContent=open?'条件を閉じる':'条件を開く'}
if(window.matchMedia('(max-width:560px)').matches)setFiltersOpen(false);else setFiltersOpen(true);
filtersToggle.addEventListener('click',()=>setFiltersOpen(filtersPanel.classList.contains('mobile-collapsed')));
window.matchMedia('(max-width:560px)').addEventListener?.('change',e=>{if(!e.matches)setFiltersOpen(true)});
const hazardTiles={flood:'https://disaportaldata.gsi.go.jp/raster/01_flood_l2_shinsuishin_data/{z}/{x}/{y}.png',tsunami:'https://disaportaldata.gsi.go.jp/raster/04_tsunami_newlegend_data/{z}/{x}/{y}.png',sediment:'https://disaportaldata.gsi.go.jp/raster/05_dosekiryukeikaikuiki/{z}/{x}/{y}.png'};
let map,mapAvailable=true,mapReady=false;
try{
  map=new maplibregl.Map({container:'map',style:'https://tiles.openfreemap.org/styles/liberty',center:[137.7,36.2],zoom:4.3,minZoom:3,maxZoom:17});
  map.addControl(new maplibregl.NavigationControl(),'top-right');
}catch(e){
  mapAvailable=false;console.error('map unavailable',e);
  document.querySelector('.map-card')?.classList.add('map-unavailable');
  $('map').innerHTML='<div class="map-fallback"><strong>地図を表示できません</strong><span>このブラウザ・端末ではWebGL2を利用できません。地価データの集計・履歴は左側の条件から引き続き確認できます。</span></div>';
  for(const id of ['layer-price','layer-flood','layer-tsunami','layer-sediment','stat-layer','layer-hospital','layer-school','layer-station','layer-restaurant']){const el=$(id);if(el)el.disabled=true}
  map={on(event,...args){if(event==='load'&&args.length===1)setTimeout(args[0],0)},addControl(){},addSource(){},addLayer(){},getSource(){return null},getLayer(){return null},setLayoutProperty(){},setPaintProperty(){},fitBounds(){},getZoom(){return 0},queryRenderedFeatures(){return[]},easeTo(){},getCanvas(){return{style:{}}}};
}
let payload,features=[],currentPriceDataset='landPrice',priceHistory=null;
function median(values){if(!values.length)return 0;const a=[...values].sort((x,y)=>x-y),m=Math.floor(a.length/2);return a.length%2?a[m]:(a[m-1]+a[m])/2}
function makeFeatures(rows){return rows.map(r=>({type:'Feature',geometry:{type:'Point',coordinates:[r[1],r[2]]},properties:{id:r[0],price:r[3],yoy:r[4],name:r[5],address:r[6],prefecture:r[7],station:r[8],stationDistance:r[9],use:r[10],area:r[11]}}))}
function visibleRows(){const pref=$('prefecture').value;return pref?features.filter(f=>f.properties.prefecture===pref):features}
function priceDatasetLabel(){return currentPriceDataset==='landSurvey'?'都道府県地価調査':'地価公示'}function updateStats(rows){$('kpi-count').textContent=fmt(rows.length);$('kpi-median').textContent=rows.length?fmt(median(rows.map(f=>f.properties.price)))+'円':'—';$('current-price-label').textContent='表示中の'+priceDatasetLabel();$('map-status').textContent=rows.length?fmt(rows.length)+'地点 / '+priceDatasetLabel()+' 2026年':'該当地点なし'}
function setPriceData(rows){if(mapReady){const source=map.getSource('land-prices');if(source)source.setData({type:'FeatureCollection',features:rows})}updateStats(rows)}
function fitRows(rows){if(!mapReady||!rows.length)return;const b=new maplibregl.LngLatBounds();rows.forEach(f=>b.extend(f.geometry.coordinates));map.fitBounds(b,{padding:45,maxZoom:10,duration:700})}
function addHazard(id,url,visible){map.addSource(id,{type:'raster',tiles:[url],tileSize:256,maxzoom:17});map.addLayer({id,source:id,type:'raster',layout:{visibility:visible?'visible':'none'},paint:{'raster-opacity':.43}})}
function setVisible(id,on){if(map.getLayer(id))map.setLayoutProperty(id,'visibility',on?'visible':'none')}
function priceColor(){return ['step',['get','price'],'#22c55e',100000,'#eab308',300000,'#f97316',1000000,'#dc2626']}
const fc=(features=[])=>({type:'FeatureCollection',features});
const esc=(s)=>String(s??'').replace(/[&<>"']/g,c=>({'&':'&amp;','<':'&lt;','>':'&gt;','"':'&quot;',"'":'&#39;'}[c]));
let municipalityFeatures=[],crimeFeatures=[];
function statLegend(kind){
  const box=$('legend');
  if(kind==='population')box.innerHTML='<strong>人口（2020）</strong><div>● 市区町村の人口規模</div>';
  else if(kind==='elderly')box.innerHTML='<strong>高齢化率（2020）</strong><div>● 65歳以上人口割合</div>';
  else if(kind==='crime')box.innerHTML='<strong>犯罪率（2025）</strong><div>● 人口千人当たり / 都道府県</div>';
  else if(kind==='accident')box.innerHTML='<strong>交通事故（2024）</strong><div>● 約1kmグリッドの事故件数</div>';
  else box.innerHTML='<strong>地価（円/㎡）</strong><div>緑 10万円未満</div><div>黄 10〜30万円</div><div>橙 30〜100万円</div><div>赤 100万円以上</div>';
}
async function initRegionalStats(){
  const [m,c]=await Promise.all([fetch('/data/municipality-stats-2026.json').then(r=>r.json()),fetch('/data/crime-prefecture-2025.json').then(r=>r.json())]);
  municipalityFeatures=m.records.filter(x=>x.lon&&x.lat).map(x=>({type:'Feature',geometry:{type:'Point',coordinates:[x.lon,x.lat]},properties:x}));
  crimeFeatures=c.records.map(x=>({type:'Feature',geometry:{type:'Point',coordinates:[x.lon,x.lat]},properties:x}));
  map.addSource('municipal-stats',{type:'geojson',data:fc(municipalityFeatures)});
  map.addSource('crime-stats',{type:'geojson',data:fc(crimeFeatures)});
  map.addLayer({id:'municipal-stat-points',type:'circle',source:'municipal-stats',layout:{visibility:'none'},paint:{'circle-stroke-color':'#fff','circle-stroke-width':1.2,'circle-opacity':.82}});
  map.addLayer({id:'crime-stat-points',type:'circle',source:'crime-stats',layout:{visibility:'none'},paint:{'circle-stroke-color':'#fff','circle-stroke-width':1.5,'circle-opacity':.85}});
  map.on('click','municipal-stat-points',e=>{const p=e.features?.[0]?.properties;if(!p)return;new maplibregl.Popup({offset:10}).setLngLat(e.features[0].geometry.coordinates).setHTML('<div class="popup-title">'+esc(p.prefecture+' '+p.municipality)+'</div><div class="popup-meta">人口 '+fmt(p.population)+'人<br>高齢化率 '+p.elderlyRate+'%<br>病院 '+fmt(p.hospitalCount)+' / 診療所 '+fmt(p.clinicCount)+'</div>').addTo(map)});
  map.on('click','crime-stat-points',e=>{const p=e.features?.[0]?.properties;if(!p)return;new maplibregl.Popup({offset:10}).setLngLat(e.features[0].geometry.coordinates).setHTML('<div class="popup-title">'+esc(p.prefecture)+'</div><div class="popup-price">'+Number(p.ratePer1000).toFixed(2)+'件/千人</div><div class="popup-meta">2025年 刑法犯認知 '+fmt(p.count)+'件<br>人口は2024年値を使用（都道府県単位）</div>').addTo(map)});
}
async function updateStatLayer(){
  const kind=$('stat-layer').value; setVisible('municipal-stat-points',kind==='population'||kind==='elderly'); setVisible('crime-stat-points',kind==='crime'); if(kind==='accident') await toggleAccidents(true); else if(accidentLoaded) await toggleAccidents(false); statLegend(kind);
  if(kind==='population'){map.setPaintProperty('municipal-stat-points','circle-color',['step',['get','population'],'#bfdbfe',30000,'#60a5fa',100000,'#2563eb',500000,'#1e3a8a']);map.setPaintProperty('municipal-stat-points','circle-radius',['step',['get','population'],4,30000,6,100000,9,500000,14,1000000,18]);}
  if(kind==='elderly'){map.setPaintProperty('municipal-stat-points','circle-color',['step',['get','elderlyRate'],'#86efac',25,'#fde047',35,'#fb923c',45,'#dc2626']);map.setPaintProperty('municipal-stat-points','circle-radius',['step',['get','elderlyRate'],5,25,7,35,10,45,13]);}
  if(kind==='crime'){map.setPaintProperty('crime-stat-points','circle-color',['step',['get','ratePer1000'],'#fde68a',3,'#fbbf24',5,'#f97316',7,'#dc2626']);map.setPaintProperty('crime-stat-points','circle-radius',['step',['get','ratePer1000'],8,3,10,5,13,7,16]);}
}
const poiConfig={
  hospital:{url:'/data/poi-hospitals-2020.json',label:'病院',color:'#0ea5e9'},
  school:{url:'/data/poi-schools-2023.json',label:'学校',color:'#8b5cf6'},
  station:{url:'/data/poi-stations-2025.json',label:'駅',color:'#059669'}
};
const poiLoaded=new Set();
function poiFeature(kind,r){
  const extra=kind==='hospital'?(r[3]||'')+(r[4]?' / 病床 '+fmt(r[4])+'床':''):kind==='school'?(r[4]||''):((r[3]||'')+(r[4]?' / '+r[4]:''));
  return {type:'Feature',geometry:{type:'Point',coordinates:[r[0],r[1]]},properties:{kind,name:r[2]||poiConfig[kind].label,extra}};
}
async function ensurePoi(kind){
  if(poiLoaded.has(kind))return;
  const cfg=poiConfig[kind],data=await fetch(cfg.url).then(r=>r.json()),src='poi-'+kind;
  map.addSource(src,{type:'geojson',data:fc(data.records.map(r=>poiFeature(kind,r))),cluster:true,clusterRadius:42,clusterMaxZoom:13});
  map.addLayer({id:src+'-clusters',type:'circle',source:src,filter:['has','point_count'],layout:{visibility:'none'},paint:{'circle-color':cfg.color,'circle-radius':['step',['get','point_count'],13,20,17,100,22],'circle-opacity':.82,'circle-stroke-color':'#fff','circle-stroke-width':1.5}});
  map.addLayer({id:src+'-count',type:'symbol',source:src,filter:['has','point_count'],layout:{visibility:'none','text-field':['get','point_count_abbreviated'],'text-size':10},paint:{'text-color':'#fff'}});
  map.addLayer({id:src+'-points',type:'circle',source:src,filter:['!', ['has','point_count']],layout:{visibility:'none'},paint:{'circle-color':cfg.color,'circle-radius':['interpolate',['linear'],['zoom'],7,3,13,6,16,8],'circle-opacity':.86,'circle-stroke-color':'#fff','circle-stroke-width':1}});
  map.on('click',src+'-clusters',async e=>{const f=e.features?.[0];if(!f)return;const z=await map.getSource(src).getClusterExpansionZoom(f.properties.cluster_id);map.easeTo({center:f.geometry.coordinates,zoom:z})});
  map.on('click',src+'-points',e=>{const p=e.features?.[0]?.properties;if(!p)return;new maplibregl.Popup({offset:10}).setLngLat(e.features[0].geometry.coordinates).setHTML('<div class="popup-title">'+esc(p.name)+'</div><div class="popup-meta">'+esc(p.extra||'')+'</div>').addTo(map)});
  poiLoaded.add(kind);
}
async function togglePoi(kind,on){
  if(on)await ensurePoi(kind);
  ['clusters','count','points'].forEach(s=>setVisible('poi-'+kind+'-'+s,on));
}
let accidentLoaded=false;
async function ensureAccidents(){
  if(accidentLoaded)return;
  const data=await fetch('/data/traffic-accidents-2024.json').then(r=>r.json());
  const fs=data.records.map(r=>({type:'Feature',geometry:{type:'Point',coordinates:[r[0],r[1]]},properties:{accidents:r[2],deaths:r[3],injuries:r[4]}}));
  map.addSource('accident-grid',{type:'geojson',data:fc(fs)});
  map.addLayer({id:'accident-heat',type:'heatmap',source:'accident-grid',layout:{visibility:'none'},paint:{'heatmap-weight':['interpolate',['linear'],['get','accidents'],1,.2,20,1],'heatmap-intensity':['interpolate',['linear'],['zoom'],4,.5,12,2],'heatmap-radius':['interpolate',['linear'],['zoom'],4,6,12,22],'heatmap-opacity':.7}});
  map.addLayer({id:'accident-points',type:'circle',source:'accident-grid',minzoom:10,layout:{visibility:'none'},paint:{'circle-color':'#ef4444','circle-radius':['step',['get','accidents'],3,3,5,8,8],'circle-opacity':.65}});
  map.on('click','accident-points',e=>{const p=e.features?.[0]?.properties;if(!p)return;new maplibregl.Popup({offset:8}).setLngLat(e.features[0].geometry.coordinates).setHTML('<div class="popup-title">交通事故（2024）</div><div class="popup-price">'+fmt(p.accidents)+'件</div><div class="popup-meta">約1kmグリッド集計 / 死者 '+fmt(p.deaths)+'人 / 負傷者 '+fmt(p.injuries)+'人</div>').addTo(map)});
  accidentLoaded=true;
}
async function toggleAccidents(on){if(on)await ensureAccidents();setVisible('accident-heat',on);setVisible('accident-points',on)}
let restaurantReady=false;
function initRestaurants(){
  if(restaurantReady)return;
  map.addLayer({id:'restaurant-points',type:'circle',source:'openmaptiles','source-layer':'poi',minzoom:14,
    filter:['match',['get','class'],['restaurant','cafe','fast_food'],true,false],
    layout:{visibility:'none'},
    paint:{'circle-color':'#f59e0b','circle-radius':['interpolate',['linear'],['zoom'],14,3,17,7],'circle-stroke-color':'#fff','circle-stroke-width':1,'circle-opacity':.9}});
  map.on('click','restaurant-points',e=>{const p=e.features?.[0]?.properties;if(!p)return;const kind=p.class==='cafe'?'カフェ':p.class==='fast_food'?'ファストフード':'飲食店';new maplibregl.Popup({offset:8}).setLngLat(e.lngLat).setHTML('<div class="popup-title">'+esc(p.name||p.name_en||'名称未登録')+'</div><div class="popup-meta">'+kind+'<br>OpenStreetMap / OpenMapTiles</div>').addTo(map)});
  restaurantReady=true;
}
function toggleRestaurants(on){
  if(on&&!restaurantReady)initRestaurants();
  setVisible('restaurant-points',on);
  if(on&&map.getZoom()<14)$('map-status').textContent='飲食店はズーム14以上で表示';
  else if(!on)$('map-status').textContent=fmt(visibleRows().length)+'地点 / '+priceDatasetLabel()+' 2026年';
}
let initialPricePromise=null;
function populatePrefOptions(){if($('prefecture').options.length>1)return;const prefs=[...new Set(features.map(f=>f.properties.prefecture).filter(Boolean))].sort((a,b)=>a.localeCompare(b,'ja'));prefs.forEach(p=>{const o=document.createElement('option');o.value=p;o.textContent=p;$('prefecture').appendChild(o)})}
function loadInitialPriceData(){if(initialPricePromise)return initialPricePromise;initialPricePromise=(async()=>{try{const data=await fetch('/data/land-prices-2026.json').then(r=>{if(!r.ok)throw new Error('地価データ取得失敗');return r.json()});if(currentPriceDataset==='landPrice'){payload=data;features=makeFeatures(data.records);populatePrefOptions();setPriceData(visibleRows())}$('loading').style.display='none';return data}catch(e){console.error(e);$('loading').textContent='地価データを読み込めませんでした';$('map-status').textContent='読み込み失敗';throw e}})();return initialPricePromise}
async function loadPriceDataset(kind){currentPriceDataset=kind;const url=kind==='landSurvey'?'/data/land-survey-2026.json':'/data/land-prices-2026.json';$('map-status').textContent=priceDatasetLabel()+'を読み込み中';const data=await fetch(url).then(r=>{if(!r.ok)throw new Error('地価データ取得失敗');return r.json()});payload=data;features=makeFeatures(data.records);populatePrefOptions();const rows=visibleRows();setPriceData(rows);if($('prefecture').value)fitRows(rows);renderPriceHistory()}
function renderPriceHistory(){if(!priceHistory)return;const kind=currentPriceDataset,series=priceHistory.series[kind]||[],pref=$('prefecture').value;const pts=series.map(s=>{const r=pref?s.prefectures.find(x=>x.prefecture===pref):null;return [s.year,r?.medianPrice??s.medianPrice]}).filter(x=>Number.isFinite(x[1]));if(!pts.length)return;const vals=pts.map(x=>x[1]),min=Math.min(...vals),max=Math.max(...vals),span=Math.max(1,max-min),w=280,h=110,pad=12;const xy=pts.map((x,i)=>[pad+i*(w-pad*2)/Math.max(1,pts.length-1),h-pad-(x[1]-min)/span*(h-pad*2)]);$('price-history-svg').innerHTML='<polyline fill="none" stroke="#1769e0" stroke-width="3" vector-effect="non-scaling-stroke" points="'+xy.map(p=>p.join(',')).join(' ')+'"/>'+xy.map((p,i)=>'<circle cx="'+p[0]+'" cy="'+p[1]+'" r="3" fill="#1769e0"><title>'+pts[i][0]+' '+fmt(pts[i][1])+'円/㎡</title></circle>').join('');$('price-history-caption').textContent=(pref||'全国')+' / '+priceDatasetLabel()+' / 中央値 '+pts[0][0]+'年 '+fmt(pts[0][1])+'円 → '+pts.at(-1)[0]+'年 '+fmt(pts.at(-1)[1])+'円';$('price-history-mini').hidden=false}
async function loadPriceHistory(){if(!priceHistory){$('price-history-load').disabled=true;$('price-history-load').textContent='読み込み中…';try{priceHistory=await fetch('/data/land-price-history.json').then(r=>{if(!r.ok)throw new Error('履歴取得失敗');return r.json()});$('price-history-load').textContent='読み込み済み'}catch(e){$('price-history-load').disabled=false;$('price-history-load').textContent='再読み込み';return}}renderPriceHistory()}
$('price-dataset').addEventListener('change',e=>loadPriceDataset(e.target.value).catch(console.error));$('price-history-load').addEventListener('click',loadPriceHistory);
loadInitialPriceData().catch(()=>{});
map.on('load',async()=>{
  mapReady=true;
  addHazard('hazard-flood',hazardTiles.flood,true);addHazard('hazard-tsunami',hazardTiles.tsunami,false);addHazard('hazard-sediment',hazardTiles.sediment,false);
  try{await initRegionalStats()}catch(e){console.error('regional stats',e)}
  try{await loadInitialPriceData();
    map.addSource('land-prices',{type:'geojson',data:{type:'FeatureCollection',features:visibleRows()},cluster:true,clusterMaxZoom:10,clusterRadius:45});
    map.addLayer({id:'price-clusters',type:'circle',source:'land-prices',filter:['has','point_count'],paint:{'circle-color':'#1769e0','circle-radius':['step',['get','point_count'],16,50,20,300,25],'circle-opacity':.88,'circle-stroke-color':'#fff','circle-stroke-width':2}});
    map.addLayer({id:'cluster-count',type:'symbol',source:'land-prices',filter:['has','point_count'],layout:{'text-field':['get','point_count_abbreviated'],'text-size':11},paint:{'text-color':'#fff'}});
    map.addLayer({id:'price-points',type:'circle',source:'land-prices',filter:['!', ['has','point_count']],paint:{'circle-color':priceColor(),'circle-radius':['interpolate',['linear'],['zoom'],5,3,10,6,14,9],'circle-stroke-color':'#fff','circle-stroke-width':1.3,'circle-opacity':.92}});
    setPriceData(visibleRows());
  }catch(e){console.error(e);$('loading').textContent='地価データを読み込めませんでした';$('map-status').textContent='読み込み失敗'}
});
$('prefecture').addEventListener('change',()=>{const rows=visibleRows();setPriceData(rows);fitRows(rows);renderPriceHistory()});
$('layer-flood').addEventListener('change',e=>setVisible('hazard-flood',e.target.checked));
$('layer-tsunami').addEventListener('change',e=>setVisible('hazard-tsunami',e.target.checked));
$('layer-sediment').addEventListener('change',e=>setVisible('hazard-sediment',e.target.checked));
$('layer-price').addEventListener('change',e=>['price-clusters','cluster-count','price-points'].forEach(id=>setVisible(id,e.target.checked)));
$('stat-layer').addEventListener('change',updateStatLayer);
$('layer-hospital').addEventListener('change',e=>togglePoi('hospital',e.target.checked));
$('layer-school').addEventListener('change',e=>togglePoi('school',e.target.checked));
$('layer-station').addEventListener('change',e=>togglePoi('station',e.target.checked));
$('layer-restaurant').addEventListener('change',e=>toggleRestaurants(e.target.checked));
map.on('click','price-clusters',async e=>{const f=map.queryRenderedFeatures(e.point,{layers:['price-clusters']})[0];if(!f)return;const source=map.getSource('land-prices');const zoom=await source.getClusterExpansionZoom(f.properties.cluster_id);map.easeTo({center:f.geometry.coordinates,zoom})});
map.on('click','price-points',e=>{const p=e.features?.[0]?.properties;if(!p)return;const yoy=p.yoy===null||p.yoy===''?'—':(Number(p.yoy)>0?'+':'')+Number(p.yoy).toFixed(1)+'%';const station=p.station?p.station+'駅'+(p.stationDistance?' '+fmt(p.stationDistance)+'m':''):'—';new maplibregl.Popup({offset:12}).setLngLat(e.features[0].geometry.coordinates).setHTML('<div class="popup-title">'+(p.name||(priceDatasetLabel()+'地点'))+'</div><div class="popup-price">'+fmt(p.price)+'円/㎡</div><div class="popup-meta">前年比 '+yoy+'<br>'+p.address+'<br>最寄り '+station+'<br>利用現況 '+(p.use||'—')+'</div>').addTo(map)});
['price-clusters','price-points'].forEach(layer=>{map.on('mouseenter',layer,()=>map.getCanvas().style.cursor='pointer');map.on('mouseleave',layer,()=>map.getCanvas().style.cursor='')});
</script>
